# LaTeX build artifacts (regenerated by latexmk). The compiled PDF (aegis.pdf)
# and the figure PDFs are kept under version control; everything below is
# generated and should not be committed. Patterns apply recursively, so they
# also cover per-figure artifacts under figures/.

# Core intermediates
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot

# latexmk / SyncTeX / engine scratch
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.run.xml
*.bcf
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb

# Backups and preview/inspection rasters
*.bak
*.bak-*
*_preview-*.png

# Unused raster export of the overview diagram (paper embeds the .pdf;
# source of truth is figures/aegis.drawio)
figures/aegis--overview--diagram.png
